### assigning an unquoted glob
logs=*.log
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2125 1:6

### assigning a numeric brace range
nums={1..5}
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2125 1:6

### single quoted glob is fine
pattern='*.log'
>>> SC2034 1:1

### assigning dollar star is fine
words=$*
>>> SC2034 1:1

### parenthesised array of a glob is fine
logs=(*.log)
>>> SC2034 1:1
